VALUES
('8f2b6c1e-5d3a-4c7b-9e1f-2a6d4b8c0e01', 'Bangkok', 'Thailand', 'TH', 'GOOGLE',
 'ChIJ82ENKDJgHTERIEjiXbIAAQE', 'Bangkok', 13.7563309, 100.5017651,
 'Thailand''s capital mixes gilded temples and royal palaces with markets, rooftop bars and some of the best street food anywhere. The old town around Rattanakosin holds the Grand Palace and Wat Pho, the Chao Phraya River links it to Wat Arun and the riverside hotels, and the BTS and MRT make Siam, Silom and Sukhumvit easy to reach.',
